=` keyword semantics\r\nchanges.\r\n\r\n[skip cirrus] [skip actions] [skip azp]\r\n\r\n* NEP: update description of `fft` changes\r\n\r\n[skip actions] [skip cirrus] [skip azp]","tree":{"sha":"e2c9a44635d6ce63c62687762d8bf4d9cccbb7a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/numpy/numpy/git/trees/e2c9a44635d6ce63c62687762d8bf4d9cccbb7a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/numpy/numpy/git/commits/6e9b286ddc6013794f5044b4f2d0800b26eab50d","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJl30IfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjTEQAGHotqYuQr72CgSGn3BSoNjm\nfjtUES/tBuYXKVBhpmH/goT85tmBsmtQywKkS9TVwIClptTB7f9nZNei2yHleq++\nNxpvfOpUchokVJ6CEor7nZYSP2WIzVc76mF6Px1Ij9nBIjgMbXQyPFV6U6J9ujSV\nFZymHhxVuGQw5hHh2gfZWO3kSXDi6VhTvibUWeY+fwp3nsNOeArHHT4BUDaUsp6W\n4UNTBAKU+b30bl0/aIT/ClDAIki3kgt8+EtngijFjRNm3C2IrrUzynFQrVNzXh/5\nLBU3eV2oWSNVIxXijGEYmPbJOLH8wH8b0Z8pJtSz7P1o2ISA5TYUvxfwP16uDJuK\nz4m79XnFFXdrw0PgYOZ9R4qxcUmUEXR4tGPuBm4q1ubt7j90wBzLwTs6kAI35e90\n4L0NHen/3ScFuIUj7bgIshFjxB3q4bvLh5OYQEGj5xT4Cwar9a56gcQXO9dDdVVa\nyx7RxJDIU7WrFtcERgfv3L8KiDHzo12rVTPjjCHa8wlCU1ses4r7grk+rpQwnsjk\nx+lbAGNflhp5srwfnzDycERDjaMIAaUhcM+rSi0rgEt4lb5J9lp+A5bswuFqAysc\nx439ArahT+CSQrXz07GuJYAnd4ZV+xuuOscf8yIfXwv4Rhq+NbeRbrp4VeL9qEJ5\nNzN+TS74ywQ2ozmecUGp\n=RskZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree e2c9a44635d6ce63c62687762d8bf4d9cccbb7a4\nparent a53b0b3777a966554add1313e22b625638282192\nauthor Ralf Gommers <ralf.gommers@gmail.com> 1709130271 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1709130271 -0700\n\nNEP: add NEP 56 on array API standard support in main namespace (#25542)\n\n* NEP: add NEP 56 on array API standard support in main namespace\r\n\r\nFor NumPy 2.0. xref gh-25076 as the main tracking issue for this topic.\r\n\r\n[skip actions] [skip azp] [skip cirrus]\r\n\r\n* DOC: rework for review comments: textual suggestions and easy changes\r\n\r\n[skip actions] [skip cirrus] [skip azp]\r\n\r\n* DOC: second batch of smaller tex